{"dur": 27.98, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Certains bureaux d'études rendent trois fois plus de plans que les autres.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 5.031, "words": [{"w": "Certains", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "bureaux", "t": 1.666}, {"w": "d'études", "t": 2.08}, {"w": "rendent", "t": 2.546}, {"w": "trois", "t": 2.96}, {"w": "fois", "t": 3.271}, {"w": "plus", "t": 3.53}, {"w": "de", "t": 3.789}, {"w": "plans", "t": 3.944}, {"w": "que", "t": 4.255}, {"w": "les", "t": 4.462}, {"w": "autres.", "t": 4.669}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "Ils ne travaillent pas plus. Ils ne sont pas plus nombreux.", "t0": 5.731, "t1": 8.561, "words": [{"w": "Ils", "t": 5.731}, {"w": "ne", "t": 5.926}, {"w": "travaillent", "t": 6.073}, {"w": "pas", "t": 6.658}, {"w": "plus.", "t": 6.854}, {"w": "Ils", "t": 7.098}, {"w": "ne", "t": 7.293}, {"w": "sont", "t": 7.439}, {"w": "pas", "t": 7.683}, {"w": "plus", "t": 7.878}, {"w": "nombreux.", "t": 8.122}]}, {"id": "reveal", "text": "Ils ont arrêté de redessiner la même chose… cent fois.", "t0": 9.361, "t1": 12.263, "words": [{"w": "Ils", "t": 9.361}, {"w": "ont", "t": 9.558}, {"w": "arrêté", "t": 9.755}, {"w": "de", "t": 10.099}, {"w": "redessiner", "t": 10.247}, {"w": "la", "t": 10.788}, {"w": "même", "t": 10.935}, {"w": "chose…", "t": 11.181}, {"w": "cent", "t": 11.771}, {"w": "fois.", "t": 12.017}]}, {"id": "explique", "text": "Parce qu'une poutre, c'est toujours la même logique. Seuls les chiffres changent.", "t0": 12.643, "t1": 17.437, "words": [{"w": "Parce", "t": 12.643}, {"w": "qu'une", "t": 13.007}, {"w": "poutre,", "t": 13.432}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 13.857}, {"w": "toujours", "t": 14.221}, {"w": "la", "t": 14.767}, {"w": "même", "t": 14.949}, {"w": "logique.", "t": 15.252}, {"w": "Seuls", "t": 15.738}, {"w": "les", "t": 16.102}, {"w": "chiffres", "t": 16.345}, {"w": "changent.", "t": 16.891}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "C'est exactement ce que fait CivRebar AI, directement dans AutoCAD.", "t0": 17.817, "t1": 22.418, "words": [{"w": "C'e